      "summary": {
        "text": "Bijoy Garg (born July 15, 2002) is an American racing driver of Indian descent. He is competing in the 24 Hours of Le Mans, IMSA SportsCar Championship, European Le Mans Series and Asian Le Mans Series for Inter Europol Competition in LMP2.\n\nGarg won the 2024 24 Hours of Le Mans in his debut with United Autosports and was the runner-up of the 2026 edition of the race. He is also the 2023 IMSA VP Racing SportsCar Challenge champion.",
